    {
      "id": 1251,
      "__component": "macro-components.faqs",
      "description": null,
      "centered": true,
      "title": [
        {
          "id": 4841,
          "text": "Pre-fill fields FAQs",
          "highlight": false,
          "color": "#475467",
          "bold": false
        }
      ],
      "faqList": [
        {
          "id": 2412,
          "header": "What is a pre-filled form?",
          "body": "It's a form that already has certain fields completed before the respondent opens it. They only fill in what's left, so the form feels shorter and faster to finish.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2414,
          "header": "How does a pre-fill link work?",
          "body": "You add the values you already know to the form's URL as parameters, or set them up in the Share tab. Each respondent gets a unique link that opens their form with those fields already populated.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2413,
          "header": "Can I pre-fill only some of the fields?",
          "body": "Yes. Pre-fill any combination of fields and leave the rest blank for the respondent to complete. You decide which details to carry in and which to ask for.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2415,
          "header": "Does pre-filling work for long surveys?",
          "body": "Absolutely. Pre-filling repetitive details like name, company, or past answers removes a lot of typing, which makes long surveys far easier to complete.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2416,
          "header": "Can respondents edit the values I pre-fill?",
          "body": "Yes. Pre-filled values are editable by default, so respondents can confirm or correct them before submitting — giving you cleaner, verified data.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2417,
          "header": "Is pre-fill available to all users?",
          "body": "Yes. You can build a form, set up pre-fill links, and share them with respondents — get started for free.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        }
      ]
    },
